  m_Name: T_SystemedSociety
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Systemed Society
  body: "My terminal has no active identity login, and in a society built entirely around Synapse, I cannot purchase anything, access public services, or use public transportation, because every transaction and movement requires a verified identity. Even basic necessities are tied to the system, making it impossible for me to function normally outside the shelter."
  clueId: clue_systemed_society